  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [fsfe/reuse-tool](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool) | repository | minor | `v5.0.2` → `v5.1.1` |\n\nNote: The `pre-commit` manager in Renovate is not supported by the `pre-commit` maintainers or community. Please do not report any problems there, instead [create a Discussion in the Renovate repository](https://redirect.github.com/renovatebot/renovate/discussions/new) if you have any questions.\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>fsfe/reuse-tool (fsfe/reuse-tool)</summary>\n\n### [`v5.1.1`](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#v511---2025-09-05)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/compare/v5.1.0...v5.1.1)\n\n##### Fixed\n\n- Fixed repository file detection using jujutsu versions 0.19.0 or later.\n  ([#&#8203;1191](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1191))\n- Fixed a bug that caused not all strings to be marked translatable. This bug\n  was introduced in v5.0.0. Strings that were already translated *before* the\n  release of v5.0.0 are now translated again. ([#&#8203;1216](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1216))\n\n### [`v5.1.0`](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#v510---2025-09-04)\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/compare/v5.0.2...v5.1.0)\n\n##### Added\n\n- Added new file extensions:\n  - `.dtd` ([#&#8203;1141](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1141))\n  - `.gperf` ([#&#8203;1131](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1131))\n  - Erlang `.erl` and `.hrl`, leex and yecc Erlang parser generators `.xrl` and\n    `.yrl` ([#&#8203;1117](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1117))\n  - Elixir (`.ex` and `.exs`) ([#&#8203;1117](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1117))\n  - Gleam (`.gleam`) ([#&#8203;1117](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1117))\n  - Lean (`.lean`, `.olean`, and `.ilean`) ([#&#8203;1188](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1188))\n- Added `--json` flag to the `supported-licenses` subcommand. ([#&#8203;1187](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1187))\n\n##### Changed\n\n- Revert `Cargo.lock` to uncommentable. ([#&#8203;1169](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1169))\n- `reuse annotate` previously would insert a newline after a header, which is\n  not always a desirable behavior. Instead of inserting a newline,\n  `reuse annotate` will now respect the existing whitespace of the file where\n  the header is being placed. When the license header is being added to a file\n  for the first time, a space will be added after the license, but subsequent\n  updates to the header will leave the whitespace alone. ([#&#8203;1136](https://redirect.github.com/fsfe/reuse-tool/issues/1136))\n- Updated `spdx-license-list-data` to v3.27.0.\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: Branch creation - At 12:00 AM through 04:59 AM and 10:00 PM through 11:59 PM, Monday through Friday ( * 0-4,22-23 * * 1-5 ), Only on Sunday and Saturday ( * * * * 0,6 ) in timezone America/Los_Angeles, Automerge - At any time (no schedule defined).\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is behind base branch, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/riscv/riscv-unified-db).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0Mi45Mi4xIiwidXBkYXRlZEluVmVyIjoiNDIuOTIuMSIsInRhcmdldEJyYW5jaCI6Im1haW4iLCJsYWJlbHMiOlsiZGVwZW5kZW5jaWVzIl19-->\n",
